  "goodToKnow": "Kleiden means to dress or clothe, and it's more formal than anziehen: sich modisch kleiden, gut gekleidet sein. It also means to suit: Der Hut kleidet dich. Etwas in Worte kleiden means to put something into words. Related: die Kleidung (clothing), das Kleid (dress), sich verkleiden (to dress up in costume, for Karneval). The proverb Kleider machen Leute (clothes make the man) is also a Gottfried Keller novella."
